# The instance types that a drill cluster can use (hosted#448).
# `make recreate ENV=drill INSTANCE_TYPE=<type>` and the dispatch input of
# drill.yml accept a type from this list only. The first type is the default
# of envs/drill.tfvars.
#
# Each type supports nested virtualization (hosted#446). Terraform turns it on
# for the family (local.nested_virtualization in main.tf), and the recreate
# verb then proves that /dev/kvm exists on the node.
m8i.2xlarge
m8i.4xlarge
